--- commit message head
KS-864: pin each portal's env-var arm in and out of staging (QA gate F-1007-1); P-1007-1 type fixes

Test only; no product change.

New ks864c-portal-env-vars.test.ts. For NODE_ENV=staging and
NODE_ENV=development, it sets ISSUER_/VERIFIER_/ADMIN_PORTAL_URL, imports a
fresh routes/system-status (vi.resetModules in beforeAll), and asserts that
each portal reports its own var. That is 6 cells. The gate's tamper G-2 (a
portal url hard-coded to its compose default) compiled and reddened 0 of
388; each portal's G-2 now reddens exactly that portal's two cells, with
tsc rc 0 on every tamper row.

P-1007-1 (the #1007 gate's Polish), in ks864a and ks864b:
- The dead `10_000` second argument to `new Promise` (TS2554) is dropped.
- The column-0 top-level `await import` (TS1378) moves into beforeAll.
- The server is typed as express's own listen() return (TS2741).
Under a type-check that includes tests, the KS-864 files go from 6 errors
to 0, and the new file adds none.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

